[gd_scene format=3]

; The Kiln, past the Sanctum's forbidden door (map offset (118, -104)): the first room of the volcanic layer, where the
; machines were fired. A stair goes down west from the door into a kiln the size of a nave, long cold: its upper floor
; lined with molds in the shape of machines, a drop at its west end to the firing floor. There the first heat breathes
; up through a crack (a low vent: jump it, or with Heat plating walk through), a pilgrim shrine, and the low door east
; on to the Slag. Ledges up the west wall climb back to the upper floor.

